‎## Long-Term Implication
‎Sequencing keeps Knowledge Quest accessible and anchored.
‎Leaves room to expand into Africa and wider world later without losing coherence.
‎
‎## Decision Filter
‎Before adding any institution to the Atlas, ask:
‎1. "Does this directly shape Kenya's digital landscape?"
‎2. "Does this generate knowledge, develop professionals, or support transformation in Kenya?"
‎If no → Save for "Global Network" expansion layer.
